        'A small cupola on a long roof looks like an afterthought. As a starting point, allow about 1.25 to 1.5 inches of cupola base width for each foot of roofline: a 20-foot roofline usually wants a 24″ to 30″ cupola, a 24-foot roofline a 30″ to 36″ cupola, and larger buildings 36″, 42″ or 48″ units.',
      ],
    },
    {
      id: 'cupolas',
      name: 'Cupola Types',
