    {
      id: 'weathervanes',
      name: 'Weathervane Styles',
      intro: [
        'Price depends on material, size, figure detail, rod height, roof access and mounting. Hardware, rod, directionals and anchoring are included. Size the figure to the building: too small looks lost on a wide roof, too large looks theatrical.',
      ],
      prices: prices.cupolas.weathervanes,
    },
    {
      id: 'packages',
      name: 'Cupola & Weathervane Packages',
      intro: [
        'Four simple ways to specify the roofline accent. The cupola with weathervane package is the strongest visual upgrade: the cupola provides mass and proportion, and the weathervane creates the silhouette.',
